  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ECHA",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "tu pan sobre las aguas; que después de muchos días lo hallarás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reparte á siete, y aun á ocho:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "porque no sabes el mal que vendrá sobre la tierra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si las nubes fueren llenas de agua, sobre la tierra la derramarán: y si el árbol cayere al mediodía, ó al norte, al lugar que el árbol cayere, allí quedará.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "El que al viento mira, no sembrará; y el que mira á las nubes, no segará.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Como",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "tú no sabes cuál es el camino del viento, ó",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "como",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "se crían",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "los huesos en el vientre de la mujer preñada, así ignoras la obra de Dios, el cual hace todas las cosas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1 Exhortación á los jóvenes.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2 El fin del discurso.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Por la mañana siembra tu simiente, y á la tarde no dejes reposar tu mano: porque tú no sabes cuál es lo mejor, si esto ó lo otro, ó si ambas á dos cosas son buenas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suave ciertamente es la luz, y agradable á los ojos ver el sol:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mas si el hombre viviere muchos años, y en todos ellos hubiere gozado alegría; si después trajere á la memoria",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "los días de las tinieblas, que serán muchos, todo lo que",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "le",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habrá pasado,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "dirá haber sido",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanidad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alégrate, mancebo, en tu mocedad, y tome placer tu corazón en los días de tu juventud; y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "anda en los caminos de tu corazón, y en la vista de tus ojos:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "mas sabe, que sobre todas estas cosas",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "te traerá Dios á juicio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quita pues el enojo de tu corazón, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "aparta el mal de tu carne: porque la mocedad y la juventud son vanidad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ECC.12",
    "number": "12",
    "bookId": "ECC"
  },
